codex
I found the exact cause: this sandbox reports PID `2` inside the process namespace while `/proc/2/exe` is absent; Lean 4.22 calls `readlink("/proc/<getpid>/exe")`, so application-path discovery fails. I’m applying a narrowly scoped audit-only preload shim that redirects only `/proc/<pid>/exe` lookups to `/proc/self/exe`, then rerunning the trusted preflight unchanged.
apply patch
