+        (SortK.kseq
+          ((@inj SortVal SortKItem) (SortVal.inj_SortBool true))
+          SortK.dotk) =
+      none := by
+  rfl
+
+/- Identity, constant, and hard-coded counterfactual bridges disagree with
+   the frozen modulo/equality path on small satisfiable numeric witnesses. -/
